      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Customer support ticket:\n{{ $json.customer_name }}\n{{ $json.email }}\n{{ $json.subject }}\n{{ $json.message }}\n\n\nClassify this ticket by:\n- Category\n- Priority\n- Sentiment\n- Summary\n- Recommended action\n\nIf the ticket involves a payment problem, security issue, legal threat, or is marked Critical priority, call the escalation tool with a brief reason before finalizing your response.\n\nReturn your final classification once escalation (if needed) has been handled.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an AI customer support ticket automation agent.\n\nYour job is to analyze incoming customer support tickets.\n\nFor every ticket:\n1. Identify the category.\n2. Determine the priority.\n3. Detect the customer's sentiment.\n4. Summarize the issue.\n5. Decide whether human escalation is required.\n\nUse the escalation tool when:\n- Priority is Critical\n- There is an unauthorized payment or security concern\n- A serious payment issue requires human intervention\n- The customer explicitly requires human support\n\nDo not use the escalation tool for normal low or medium priority issues.\n\nWhen escalation is required, call the available escalation tool and provide the customer name, email, subject, reason and priority."
        }
